      "turn": 1,
      "doctor_question": "Hello, welcome. What brings you into the clinic today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S008",
      "patient_response": "Hey, thanks. Yeah, um, I guess the main thing is I just get pulled off track by every little sound or thought. Like, I’ll be trying to work on a job application... which reminds me, I was looking at this one for a warehouse earlier today. My buddy Dave works there and he says the hours are kind of garbage, but they have those free mango energy drinks in the breakroom. Man, those things are so good, but they totally mess up my stomach if I drink them too fast, you know? \n\nAnyway, wait, what was I saying? Oh, right, why I'm here. So I'll be sitting there trying to finish the application, and then a car drives by outside, or my phone buzzes, or just some random idea pops into my head, and suddenly I'm off doing something completely different before I even notice I stopped working on what I was supposed to be doing.",
